{"id":"553707b7a7425e75","group":"92","path":"92/92-fact-henkin-sigma1.md","title":"fact-henkin-sigma1 — Henkin Sentence is Sigma 1","display":"fact-henkin-sigma1 — Henkin Sentence is Sigma_1","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-fact-henkin-sigma1","aliases":["92-fact-henkin-sigma1"],"display":"fact-henkin-sigma1 — Henkin Sentence is Sigma_1","depends_on":["[[92-df-henkin-sentence]]","[[92-df-sigma1-formula]]","[[92-fact-provability-sigma1]]","[[92-df-delta0-formula]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-fact-henkin-sigma1"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-fact-henkin-sigma1</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-henkin-sigma1 — Henkin Sentence is Sigma_1"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"67317965f7ebd660\" href=\"?note=67317965f7ebd660\" title=\"92-df-henkin-sentence\">92-df-henkin-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8fd1dce21b2c65db\" href=\"?note=8fd1dce21b2c65db\" title=\"92-df-sigma1-formula\">92-df-sigma1-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"076e69cbf2d46206\" href=\"?note=076e69cbf2d46206\" title=\"92-fact-provability-sigma1\">92-fact-provability-sigma1</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d754a154b50a9533\" href=\"?note=d754a154b50a9533\" title=\"92-df-delta0-formula\">92-df-delta0-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f3fdd55235f4984e\" href=\"?note=f3fdd55235f4984e\" title=\"92-thm-diagonal-lemma\">92-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G\\)</span> (Henkin-sentence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"67317965f7ebd660\" href=\"?note=67317965f7ebd660\" title=\"92-df-henkin-sentence\">92-df-henkin-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G\\)</span> (bounded internal proof formula and induced provability formula)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span> (first existential level, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8fd1dce21b2c65db\" href=\"?note=8fd1dce21b2c65db\" title=\"92-df-sigma1-formula\">92-df-sigma1-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic strength for complexity-preserving diagonalization)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}sigma1}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\land\n\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\\land\n\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\cap\\Sigma_1^G\\;\n\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G(H)\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}sigma1}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\land\n\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\\land\n\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\cap\\Sigma_1^G\\;\n\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G(H)\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>标准的复杂度保持对角构造可选择一个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span> Henkin句</li>\n<li>内部<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\)</span>由<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists v_1\\,\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\">\\(\\exists v_1\\,\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\)</span>得到；外部关系<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span>不是公式</li>\n<li>不是每个只在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中满足Henkin固定点等价的任意见证都必须具有同一字面复杂度，因此把原来的全称断言改为规范见证的存在断言</li>\n<li>&quot;存在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>是我的证明&quot;</li>\n<li>Henkin句的可证性还需要<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>满足Löb定理所用的可证性条件，不能只由层级归类推出</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-henkin-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"67317965f7ebd660","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-henkin-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sigma1-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8fd1dce21b2c65db","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sigma1-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-fact-provability-sigma1","status":"resolved","id":"076e69cbf2d46206","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-fact-provability-sigma1]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-delta0-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d754a154b50a9533","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-delta0-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-axiom-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f3fdd55235f4984e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-henkin-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"67317965f7ebd660","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G$ (Henkin-sentence predicate, see [[92-df-henkin-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sigma1-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8fd1dce21b2c65db","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_1^G$ (first existential level, see [[92-df-sigma1-formula]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1^G","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}sigma1}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\land\n\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\\land\n\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\cap\\Sigma_1^G\\;\n\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G(H)\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists v_1\\,\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1705,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["67317965f7ebd660","8fd1dce21b2c65db","076e69cbf2d46206","d754a154b50a9533","35c764f4e9f21f28","468d35690d25ee42","f3fdd55235f4984e"]}